        "text": "**Developing Translation Functionality**\n\nI've just finished the initial setup. I've successfully created the `translate_markup.py` file, incorporating the core logic to leverage the Google Cloud Translation API for the necessary text translation. This initial implementation includes the essential import statement for `google.cloud.translate` and the primary function, `translate_markup`, which is equipped to handle `text`, `source_language`, and `target_language`.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Implementation**\n\nI've completed the implementation of the `translate_markup.py` file. I've successfully incorporated the Google Cloud Translation API. The file includes the import statement for `google.cloud.translate`, the `translate_markup` function accepting `text`, `source_language`, and `target_language`. I initialized `TranslationServiceClient()` and included a placeholder for `YOUR_PROJECT_ID`. I also made sure to use `mime_type=\"text/html\"` in the `translate_text` method call. The example usage in the `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` block is ready, and basic error handling instructions are present. The task is now complete.\n\n\n",
