      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Core Process**\n\nI'm focusing on defining the essential process for the script. I've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API as the external translation provider, and this will be clearly indicated in the Python file. The next step is a concrete plan to move forward.\n\n\n**Outlining the Python File**\n\nI've sketched the structure of `batch_translate.py`. I've outlined the core `batch_translate_strings` function, which leverages the Google Cloud Translation API. The file will include the necessary `from google.cloud` import to make it clear which external provider is being used for the translations. The function itself will take the list of strings to be translated, along with the target language and project ID as parameters.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819376230,
          "start": 1789819374476
